{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game, that supposed to be an ordinary, but developer accidentally made a fatal error, that completely brokes the game, and transforms it into a horror-game. Now, your goal is to somehow, fix the fatal error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SOUND SCALE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the main mechanic of the game. Captures a certain game sound. When it reaches to a certain number, something happens to make more difficult experience in the location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444750/extras/8368be246946d15788a229cf5cdd078c.poster.avif?t=1746113683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444750/extras/8368be246946d15788a229cf5cdd078c.webm?t=1746113683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444750/extras/8368be246946d15788a229cf5cdd078c.mp4?t=1746113683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE DIFFERENT LOCATIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has some different locations. Each location stands out in some way. Each has a different atmosphere, and tries to make, unsettling feeling. Keep in mind that, some locations can have different mechanics, but in every location, you need to collect something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNUSUAL: CHARACTERS, STORYLINE, BOSSES, AND OTHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is have some, unusual characters. Some characters know, that they in the game, that this is the player, and they're enemy or friend of the player. Storyline stands out by, fatal error that brokes the game. Some bosses are bosses, that didn't enter to a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https:/